# moe-hotcache ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** llama.cpp fork with dynamic hot-expert caching and host-RAM access to GPU.

**LEONES status:** P2 candidate; reproduction pending.

## Summary

moe-hotcache keeps frequently used experts in a small GPU cache while maintaining a larger host-memory pool. Cache contents can change dynamically with workload behaviour.

## ODS fit

This is a natural candidate for the ODS low-VRAM MoE strategy because it retains llama.cpp compatibility while experimenting with expert locality.

Quality, correctness and performance must be independently verified before adoption.